  "reference": "1 Ayi 21",
  "verseCount": 27,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "21",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1KI 21"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mgunda wa mipeleya wa Naboti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwine lina lyakwe Naboti ŵakwete mgunda ŵa mpeleya, mwakuŵandikana ni nyumba ja ucimwene ja Ahabu ku Yesilele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line Ahabu ŵamsalile Naboti kuti, “Mumbe une mgunda wenuwu kuti uŵe litimbe lyangu, pakuŵa uŵandikene ni nyumba jangu. M'malo mwakwe tinampe mgunda wine wambone, kapena naga mkusosa, tisume pa mtengo wakwenela mgundawo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboti ŵajanjile kuti, “Mgunda welewu uli wa acinangolo ŵangu, kutandila kalakala. Ni ngulumbila pali AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " kuti ngakomboleka une kwapa ŵalakwe wele mgundawu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Ahabu ŵajawile ku nyumba jawo ali atumbile ni ŵangasangalala, ligongo lya maloŵe giŵajanjile Naboti gala. Nipo Ahabu ŵagonile pa cindanda jakwe ali alolite kwipupa, nipo ŵakanile kulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Yesebele, ŵamkwawo Ahabu ŵala, ŵajawile kwa jwalakwe ni ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ligongo cici ngope jenu jikuwoneka jangasangalala, soni ngamkusosa kulya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabu ŵajanjile ŵamkwawowo kuti, “Ligongo lyakwe lili maloŵe gaŵecete Naboti kwa une. Une naŵecete ni Naboti kuti ambe mgunda wakwe wa mpeleyawu kuti sume, kapena naga akusaka, mbelece mgunda ŵine m'malo mwakwe. Nambo jwalakwejo akanile kumba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesebele ŵamwusisye Ahabu kuti, “Ana ngati ŵalakwe mwenye jwa ku Isalaeli? Ajimuce, asangalale, soni akalye. Une tingajigalile wele mgunda wa mpeleyawo kwa Naboti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Naboti akuwulajidwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Yesebele ŵalembile yikalata kwa acakulungwakulungwa ni kwa ŵakulongolela msinda uŵatamaga ku Yesilele. Myikalatamo ŵalembile kuti, “Mwagombelesye ŵandu kuti atame ŵangalya cakulya, ŵaŵilanje ŵandu wosopewo pa malo gamo, nipo amtamice Naboti pa malo gakucimbicika. Mwajigale ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵakusakala mtima ayice pasogolo pa jwalakwe, nipo ŵalambucisye kuti, ‘M'mwe Naboti, mumlwesile Mlungu ni soni mwenye.’ Nipo panyuma pakwe mumkopocesye kusa kwa msindawo, nipo mumsome maganga mpaka awe.” Nipo ŵasayine yikalatayo lina lya Ahabu ni ŵayidindile cidindo ca mwenyejo. Nipo ŵayitumisye kwa ŵakulongolela msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.8+1KI.21.9+1KI.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.8",
              "1KI.21.9",
              "1KI.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo ŵandu, pamo ni acakulungwakulungwa ŵa msinda wa Yesilele ŵayitesile yiŵalamwile Yesebele, ŵamkwawo mwenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwakulungwa ŵala ŵagombelecesye ŵandu kuti akalya cakulya, nipo ŵandu wosope ŵasongene pa malo gamo, ni ŵamtamice Naboti pa malo gakucimbicika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵaŵili ŵakusakala mtima ŵala, ŵamlambucisye Naboti pameso pa likuga lya ŵandu, ŵatite, “Nabotiŵa ŵamlwesile Mlungu soni ni mwenye ŵakwe.” Myoyo ŵanduwo ŵamkopocesye Naboti kusa kwa msinda, ŵamsomile maganga mpaka ŵamwuleje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵatumisye maloŵe kwa Yesebele gakuti, “Akuno Naboti jula tukolosisye, nipo awile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesebele piŵapikene kuti Naboti awile, mwacitemacitema ŵamsalile Ahabu kuti, “Jimukani, mkajigale mgunda wa mpeleya uŵakanyaga Naboti kumsumisya ula, pakuti Naboti awile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cagamba kupikana Ahabu kuti Naboti awile, ŵajile kumgunda wa mpeleya wa Naboti, nipo ŵawujigele kuti uŵe wakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliya akumsalila Ahabu kuti liŵasa lyakwe lyosope tilicijonasika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo AMBUJE ŵamsalile Eliya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakulocesya jwakutyocela ku Tishibe kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mjawule kwa Mwenye Ahabu jwakutama ku Samaliya. Jwalakweju ali mu mgunda wa mpeleya ŵa Naboti. Ajawile kweleko kuti akajigale mgundawo kuti uŵe wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano mkamsalile kuti, AMBUJE akumwusya m'mwejo kuti, ‘Ana m'mweji mwuleje mundu, ni kujigala cipanje cakwe?’ Ni mkamsalile soni kuti, ‘AMBUJE akuti, pa malo gelego m'mbwa syalapitaga miasi ja Naboti, pa malo gagogo m'mbwa tisicilapita miasi jenu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.22.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Ayi 22:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eliya piŵamsimene jwalakwe, Ahabu ŵamwusiye Eliya kuti, “Ana musimene lelo, m'mwe m'magongo jwangu?” Eliya ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo nimsimene, ligongo ŵalakwe mwenye alipelece mnope, kutenda yindu yosope yakusakala yakuŵengana nayo AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo AMBUJE akusala kuti, ‘Tinamjonanje, kutandila m'mwejo ni jwamlume jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa mwenu, jwamkulungwa kapena mwanace, tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Liŵasa lyenu tilimale kuŵa mpela mulyamalile liŵasa lya Mwenye Yelobowamu mwanace jwa Nebati, ni soni mpela liŵasa lya Basha mwanace jwa Ahiya. Nombe m'mwejo mundumbilisye, ligongo mwatendesye kulemwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isalaeli.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano kusala ya Yesebele, AMBUJE akuti m'mbwa ticisimlya jwalakwejo mkati mwa msinda wa Yesilele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.9.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ayi 9:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa lya Ahabu jutaciwila mu msinda, m'mbwa ticisimlya. Nipo jwalijose jwa mwiŵasa lyelelyo jutaciwila mwitinji, tiyicimlya yijuni ya mwinani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Paliji pangali mundu jwine juŵalipelece mnope kutenda yindu yakusakala, ni kumlemwecesya AMBUJE mpela Ahabu, juŵanyenjece ni Yesebele ŵamkwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
