          "text": " wakutesya soni mnope pakulambila milungu ja cilendo, mpela muŵatendelaga ŵandu ŵa mtundu wa Aamoli ŵala, mtundu wa ŵandu wele AMBUJE ŵawutopwele ndaŵi jiŵayikaga Aisalaeli.",
